OL,3,GNEWSAStudents' meal deal society goes
OL,4,Aviral after supermarket trip attracts
OL,5,Amillions
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the age of social media, few
OL,8,Flunch-time topics spark as much debate
OL,9,Fas the humble meal deal.
OL,11,FShould you choose a sandwich, pasta pot
OL,12,For sushi as your main? Is a bag of
OL,13,Fcrisps the best snack, or can a
OL,14,Fchocolate bar offer better value? And
OL,15,Fwhat drink gives you the most for your
OL,16,Fmoney?
OL,18,FAt the University of Birmingham, those
OL,19,Fquestions have inspired an entire
OL,20,Fstudent society dedicated to
OL,21,Fdiscussing, buying and enjoying meal
OL,22,Fdeals.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
