OL,3,GNEWSAStudents' meal deal society goes
OL,4,Aviral after supermarket trip attracts
OL,5,Amillions
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Meal Deal Society was originally
OL,8,Ffounded before the Covid-19 pandemic
OL,9,Fbut gradually faded away. Now it has
OL,10,Fbeen revived for the new academic year
OL,11,Fand has quickly attracted a following.
